{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "b1a9f0e2-1c3d-4e5f-8a7b-0c1d2e3f4a5b",
		"name": "blogPie-v2",
		"description": "Collection da API v2 do blogPie (Django REST Framework + SimpleJWT).\n\n## Como usar\n1. Ajuste a variavel `base_url` se necessario (padrao: http://localhost:8000).\n2. Preencha `username` e `password` de um usuario existente (ou crie um em Users > Create user, que e publico).\n3. Rode **Auth > Login (obter token)**. O script de teste salva automaticamente `access_token` e `refresh_token`.\n4. As requisicoes autenticadas usam `Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}` herdado da collection.\n\n## Permissoes\n- Criar usuario (POST /api/users/) e publico.\n- Categories, Posts e Comments: leitura (GET) publica, escrita exige token.\n- Demais acoes de Users exigem token.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{access_token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Auth",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Login (obter token)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    const data = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', data.access);",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', data.refresh);",
									"    console.log('Tokens salvos nas variaveis da collection.');",
									"} else {",
									"    console.log('Falha no login:', pm.response.code);",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"auth": {
							"type": "noauth"
						},
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n    \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/login/",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"login",
								""
							]
						},
						"description": "Recebe username + password e retorna os tokens `access` e `refresh`. O script de teste salva ambos automaticamente."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Refresh token",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    const data = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', data.access);",
									"    console.log('access_token renovado.');",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"auth": {
							"type": "noauth"
						},
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"refresh\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/login/refresh/",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"login",
								"refresh",
								""
							]
						},
						"description": "Recebe o `refresh` token e devolve um novo `access` token."
					}
				}
			]
		},
